      ro: ["Cel mai mare oraș din partea de nord a Ciadului.", "Capitala regiunii administrative Borkou.", "Centru de oază important pentru cultura curmalelor.", "Aerodrom militar strategic (cod IATA: FYT).", "Numit anterior după colonelul francez Largeau.", "Temperaturile depășesc frecvent 40 de grade Celsius."],
      en: ["Largest city located in the northern region of Chad.", "Capital city of the Borkou administrative region.", "Major oasis center renowned for high-quality dates.", "Strategic military airfield with IATA code FYT.", "Formerly named after the French Colonel Étienne Largeau.", "Temperatures frequently rise above 40 degrees Celsius."],
