      en: ["Capital city of the Lac region in western Chad.", "Situated directly on the shores of Lake Chad.", "Center for polder-based cultivation of grains and vegetables.", "Major hub for the regional commercial fishing industry.", "Population is estimated at approximately 11,000 residents.", "Features a regional airport with the IATA code OTC."],
